# Generated files safety

Never manually edit generated or compiled artifacts. Update sources/generators and regenerate.

## Generated/compiled paths

- `helium-vscode-tooling/generated/**`
- `helium-dsl-language-server/out/**`
- `helium-dsl-language-server/generated/**`
- `helium-vscode-tooling/helium-dsl-vscode/out/**`
- `helium-vscode-tooling/dist/**`
- `helium-vscode-tooling/helium-dsl-vscode/server/out/**`

## Required workflow

- Change scripts/source (`src/**`, `scripts/**`) first.
- Regenerate with build/package scripts.
- Do not plan direct manual edits for generated outputs.
